        "TileImage": "$($repository 7af86858-df9d-478b-b5d8-803379cd165f).Image",
        "Description": "A mysterious client, only known by the name of &quot;Atticus&quot;, has a very interesting target--well, two to be exact. Ever heard of Bonnie &amp; Clyde, Agent 47? Well, Richard and Susan Wilson are quite similar. The pair commit serial murders together. Richard&apos;s the brawn and Susan the brains. Together, they&apos;ve totalled over 34 deaths in the state of Wisconsin. And now today, in their small suburban neighborhood, are hosting a barbeque.\r\rAtticus has requested these two come to an explosive end.",
